<title>USA: USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - Nov 19.</title>
<headline>USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - Nov 19.</headline>
<text>
<p>Est daily livestock slaughter under Fed inspection - USDA</p>
<p>					  CATTLE	CALVES     HOGS</p>
<p>Tuesday    11/19/96 (est)	 133,000	7,000     365,000</p>
<p>Week ago (est)			132,000	7,000     360,000</p>
